{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23989","headline":"府中夜赏 · 白居易","name":"府中夜赏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"樱桃厅院春偏好，石井栏堂夜更幽。\n白粉墙头花半出，绯纱烛下水平流。\n闲留宾客尝新酒，醉领笙歌上小舟。\n舞袖飘颻櫂容与，忽疑身是梦中游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23989.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23989","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}